sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer
  participant A as API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant P as Provider
  participant W as Worker
  C->>A: reserve with Idempotency-Key
  A->>D: lock event; conditional inventory; booking; outbox; result
  D-->>A: commit
  C->>A: checkout with Idempotency-Key
  A->>D: persist financial operation identity
  D-->>A: commit
  A->>P: create session using stored identity
  A->>D: save response or uncertainty
  P->>A: signed raw-body webhook
  A->>D: durable unique inbox
  A-->>P: 2xx
  W->>D: claim inbox then lock event/booking/category/payment
  W->>D: database-time eligibility; confirmation or compensation; outbox
  Note over W,D: no network calls inside business transactions
